    "created_at": "2016-11-07T15:54:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-07T15:54:52Z",
    "body": "Except, obviously, for the fact that if you poke at _yourself_ you should keep seeing the same function even across a document.domain change....\n\nDid we ever write down clearly what actual invariants we are trying to enforce here, as opposed to just the algorithm doing the enforcing?  That is do we know what this thing is _trying_ to do?\n",
